  Expected scientific interpretation
    Zero false permits on the should-deny population establishes soundness on this corpus; the
    Wilson 95% upper bound (not the point estimate of 0) is the honest ceiling given n=492. Zero
    false denials establishes that soundness was not bought by denying everything. This experiment
    does NOT establish generalisation beyond ULB — that is E7's job.

