  Throughput and scaling (disclosed negative result)
    Threads  Throughput (dec/s)  Speedup  Efficiency  CPU util    p99 ms  Peak RSS
    ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    1                   224,475   1.000×       1.000      0.99  0.003250    2.1 GB
